ir -w actually work — it was a stub no-op before); hfst-compose threads a CLI-local FLAG_IS_EPSILON; hfst-regexp2fst/-lexc-compiler route --xfst flag-is-epsilon + no-minimize through their compiler setters. encode-weights stays inert (preserved) in regexp2fst/lexc (wiring it would need threading through every compiler minimize/optimize). Oracle: 153 passed (152 hfst + 1 hfst-cli smoke), 14 skipped. NOT done here (separate item): the 2 backend hopcroft atomics (OPENFST_TROPICAL/LOG_USE_HOPCROFT) are now FULLY ORPHANED by deleting minimization_algorithm's side-effect (set_hopcroft has no callers, get_hopcroft never had any) — trivial follow-up removal. xerox_composition still deferred (pmatch-toggled)."
