    {
        id idiom-ratchet
        title "Idiom ratchet — convert one-time idiomatisation sweeps into enforced lint gates + burn down the debt accrued since idiom6/8/9 closed. Empirical finding (2026-07-12): the invariants backed by a workspace lint held at exactly zero across 8 subsequent feature waves (unsafe_code=forbid, clippy::wildcard_enum_match_arm=deny, rust_2018_idioms=deny → 0/0/0); the hand-swept conventions with NO lint decayed — .unwrap() 0→390 (non-test hfst lib), camelCase locals reappeared (240). Method per dimension: burn the debt to zero, THEN add the workspace lint that keeps it there. Deliberately NOT gating clippy::expect_used — .expect(\\\"reason\\\") is the sanctioned idiom (229 compliant sites carry real invariant reasons); gating it would fight the correct pattern."
        priority 0
        children (
            {
                id idiom-ratchet.unwrap
                title "Burn down the 390 non-test .unwrap() in the hfst lib + install the deny gate. Distribution: tropical_weight_transducer 202 (rustfst VectorFst construction — set_start/set_final/add_tr all return Result, every call unwrapped; only 2 of 135 fns even return Result, so the backend was given an infallible surface that swallows rustfst fallibility), pmatch 51, pmatch_compiler 33, xfst_compiler 25, ospell 24, hfst_xerox_rules 13, transducer 9, hfst_ol_transducer 8, convert_tropical_weight_transducer 7, hfst_basic_transducer 6, xre 3, rest ≤2. Convert: .expect(\\\"invariant reason\\\") where infallible-by-construction (op on a state/fst just created — copy the 229 existing good expects), ?/Result where genuinely fallible (I/O, conversion, parse). Add clippy.toml allow-unwrap-in-tests=true + allow-expect-in-tests=true so the gate never fires on test fixtures. GATE: add clippy::unwrap_used=\\\"deny\\\" to [workspace.lints.clippy]; cargo build --workspace --all-targets clean under it. Restores the no-unwrap-rule idiom6 hand-swept to zero and 8 waves regressed — now lint-enforced so it can't recur."
                priority 0
                log (
                    {
                        at 2026-07-12T20:46:50.356785Z
                        author "brendan@necessary.nu"
                        kind @status
                        text "Todo → Done (nplan_complete)"
                    }
                )
            }

