                id fork-property-propagation
                title "rustfst: encode mapper stamps ACCEPTOR/UNWEIGHTED; propagate weightedness/acceptor knowledge so acceptor_minimize's compute_and_update_properties stops re-running full SCC DFS per minimize (~15% of xfst CPU); byte-identical oracles"
                log (
