        title "Nativize xerox flag encode/decode for tropical: encode/decode_flag_diacritics do a full basic round-trip 4× per xerox compose (~14% of the speller xfst script); pure symbol-string rename → O(alphabet) in-place SymbolTable edit (A2 pattern); byte-identity expected, speller-artifact cmp decides"
        log (
            {
                at 2026-07-19T16:28:56.228187Z
